---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /fixtures/
title: Fixtures & results
lede: Every Division 1 match this season. Pick a round to jump through the calendar.
eleventyComputed:
  eyebrow: "Season {{ site.currentSeason }}"
---
{% import "macros.njk" as w %}
{% set d1 = site.sofascore.division1 %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">{{ d1.label }}</div>
        <h2>Round by round</h2>
        <p>Kick-off times, scores and postponements, live from Sofascore.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="round-picker">
        <label for="round-select">Round</label>
        <select id="round-select"
                data-round-select
                data-target="fixtures-frame"
                data-src-template="{{ w.fixturesUrl(site, d1, '__ROUND__', d1.label + ' · Round __ROUND__') }}">
          {% for n in range(1, d1.rounds + 1) %}
          <option value="{{ n }}" data-label="{{ d1.label }} · Round {{ n }}"{% if n == d1.currentRound %} selected{% endif %}>Round {{ n }}</option>
          {% endfor %}
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal>
      {{ w.frame("fixtures-frame", d1.label + " · Round " + d1.currentRound, w.fixturesUrl(site, d1, d1.currentRound), 760, d1.pageUrl, "All fixtures") }}
    </div>

    <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:1rem">
      Fixtures move — pitches get double-booked, shows get delivered. Sofascore is always the source of truth,
      and anything major gets posted to <a href="/news/">News</a> and Instagram.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--3">
      <a class="card" href="{{ site.sofascore.cup.pageUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-reveal>
        <span class="card__num">Cup</span>
        <h3>VFL Cup ↗</h3>
        <p>Straight knockout. Draw, ties and extra time, on Sofascore.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="{{ site.sofascore.charityShield.pageUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-reveal>
        <span class="card__num">Shield</span>
        <h3>Charity Shield ↗</h3>
        <p>Champions vs cup holders, played to open the season.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="{{ site.sofascore.division2.pageUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-reveal>
        <span class="card__num">Div 2</span>
        <h3>Division 2 ↗</h3>
        <p>Second-tier fixtures and results.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
